Files adapted from DataHub (each carries an attribution header):

- eslint-rules/git-baseline.mjs
    git-baseline grandfathering logic adapted from
    datahub-web-react/eslint-rules/no-antd-imports.js (rewritten as a reusable helper)
- .claude/hooks/deny-git-no-verify.sh
    from .claude/hooks/deny-git-no-verify.sh (near-verbatim)
- .agent-skills/review/standards/typescript.md
    rule format ("if X, then flag it, with this title") from .cursor/BUGBOT.md;
    every rule is Trellis's own

Patterns re-implemented from scratch after reading DataHub (no code copied): semantic colour tokens
and the no-hardcoded-colors rule, the ui-boundary rule, useDebouncedCallback / useStableValue /
useLatest / usePagination hooks, the typed analytics event union, the i18n parity check, the
three-level bundle budget, the Playwright fixture layout, and the agent-tooling layout
(.agent-skills/<skill>/{SKILL.md,standards,templates,scripts,references} with name/description
frontmatter, and a .claude/settings.json allowlist plus PreToolUse hook) after DataHub's
.agent-skills/ and .claude/; the allowlist, the skills and their contents are Trellis's own.

